  "scope": [
    "The new mounted GUI fixture exercises the actual application controls, external Win32 file operations, flush, window-close retention, junction retirement and byte-exact reattachment.",
    "Windows Sandbox ran headless on a Windows 11 Enterprise guest. The host-side admission denied the mounted test before invoking the app, and the existing host driver remained stopped.",
    "Windows Installer stopped progressing during software restriction policy verification. The same stage was observed after the signed package validated in a normally networked guest. The mounted workflow was therefore unexecuted.",
    "These were correctness attempts. Performance and compression comparisons are reserved for the real Windows host."
  ]
